---
// src/components/About.astro
---

<section id="nosotros" class="py-24 bg-gray-50 border-y border-gray-200/80">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    
    <!-- Encabezado de Nosotros -->
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto text-center mb-16">
      <span class="text-xs uppercase tracking-widest font-bold text-brand-blue bg-blue-50 px-3 py-1 rounded-full border border-blue-200/60">
        ADN LLAREK
      </span>
      <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold text-brand-graphite mt-3 tracking-tight">
        Nuestra Filosofía y Pilares
      </h2>
      <div class="w-16 h-1 bg-brand-orange mx-auto mt-4 rounded-full"></div>
      <p class="text-gray-600 mt-4 text-base sm:text-lg">
        Más de una década construyendo confianza mediante metodologías constructivas rigurosas y un equipo multidisciplinario altamente calificado.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Cuadrícula de 4 columnas -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-8">
      
      <!-- Valor 1: Precisión -->
      <div class="bg-white p-8 rounded-xl border border-gray-200/70 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow group flex flex-col items-center text-center">
        <div class="w-16 h-16 rounded-2xl bg-blue-50 text-brand-blue group-hover:bg-brand-blue group-hover:text-white transition-colors duration-300 flex items-center justify-center mb-6 shadow-inner">
          <svg class="w-8 h-8 stroke-current" fill="none" stroke-width="1.8" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle>
            <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="6"></circle>
            <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="2"></circle>
            <path stroke-linecap="round" d="M12 2v2m0 16v2M2 12h2m16 0h2"></path>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-brand-graphite mb-3">Precisión</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">
          Exactitud milimétrica en cada cálculo, replanteo y montaje. La tolerancia cero a errores es nuestro estándar operacional.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Valor 2: Innovación -->
      <div class="bg-white p-8 rounded-xl border border-gray-200/70 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow group flex flex-col items-center text-center">
        <div class="w-16 h-16 rounded-2xl bg-orange-50 text-brand-orange group-hover:bg-brand-orange group-hover:text-white transition-colors duration-300 flex items-center justify-center mb-6 shadow-inner">
          <svg class="w-8 h-8 stroke-current" fill="none" stroke-width="1.8" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9.663 17h4.673M12 3v1m6.364 1.636l-.707.707M21 12h-1M4 12H3m3.343-5.657l-.707-.707m2.828 9.9a5 5 0 117.072 0l-.548.547A3.374 3.374 0 0014 18.469V19a2 2 0 11-4 0v-.531c0-.895-.356-1.754-.988-2.386l-.548-.547z"></path>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-brand-graphite mb-3">Innovación</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">
          Adopción continua de tecnología BIM, escaneo láser 3D y materiales sustentables para liderar la evolución del sector constructivo.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Valor 3: Compromiso -->
      <div class="bg-white p-8 rounded-xl border border-gray-200/70 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow group flex flex-col items-center text-center">
        <div class="w-16 h-16 rounded-2xl bg-blue-50 text-brand-blue group-hover:bg-brand-blue group-hover:text-white transition-colors duration-300 flex items-center justify-center mb-6 shadow-inner">
          <svg class="w-8 h-8 stroke-current" fill="none" stroke-width="1.8" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m5.618-4.016A11.955 11.955 0 0112 2.944a11.955 11.955 0 01-8.618 3.04A12.02 12.02 0 003 9c0 5.591 3.824 10.29 9 11.622 5.176-1.332 9-6.03 9-11.622 0-1.042-.133-2.052-.382-3.016z"></path>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-brand-graphite mb-3">Compromiso</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">
          Cumplimiento cabal de plazos pactados y presupuestos acordados. Respetamos la palabra y la confianza de cada cliente.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Valor 4: Excelencia -->
      <div class="bg-white p-8 rounded-xl border border-gray-200/70 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow group flex flex-col items-center text-center">
        <div class="w-16 h-16 rounded-2xl bg-orange-50 text-brand-orange group-hover:bg-brand-orange group-hover:text-white transition-colors duration-300 flex items-center justify-center mb-6 shadow-inner">
          <svg class="w-8 h-8 stroke-current" fill="none" stroke-width="1.8" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M11.049 2.927c.3-.921 1.603-.921 1.902 0l1.519 4.674a1 1 0 00.95.69h4.915c.969 0 1.371 1.24.588 1.81l-3.976 2.888a1 1 0 00-.363 1.118l1.518 4.674c.3.922-.755 1.688-1.538 1.118l-3.976-2.888a1 1 0 00-1.176 0l-3.976 2.888c-.783.57-1.838-.197-1.538-1.118l1.518-4.674a1 1 0 00-.363-1.118l-3.976-2.888c-.784-.57-.38-1.81.588-1.81h4.914a1 1 0 00.951-.69l1.519-4.674z"></path>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-brand-graphite mb-3">Excelencia</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">
          Acabados superiores y calidad certificada bajo los más altos estándares constructivos internacionales y normativas vigentes.
        </p>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>